Thu Sep 24 23:11:34 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to 4.0.0-rc-7
  * New features and improvements
    + Log API enhancements and mojo MDC
    + Optimize reactor sort and phase comparator performance
    + Add AsyncDrainWriter to eliminate PrintWriter lock contention
    + Add validation for Plexus-based plugin dependency injection
  * Maintenance
    + Externalize default lifecycle plugin versions to POM
      properties
    + Fixes #13135: address review on reactor summary (UNKNOWN
      group, local StringBuilder)
    + chore: add toolbox:plugin-versions workflow for lifecycle
      plugin versions
    + Replace static TestSuiteOrdering registry with dynamic class
      orderer
    + Implement getOutputPath() in the site IT plugin
    + Update NOTICE file in distribution packages
    + Optimize computeLocations() and simplify ModelObjectPool
      location handling
    + deps: Bump Mimir to 0.12.3
    + Restrict what a repository-resolved model contributes to the
      build
    + Output, transport and consumer POM robustness fixes
    + Validate coordinates and repository precedence during
      artifact resolution
    + Fix flaky FastTerminalReentrancyTest by avoiding PTY creation
    + Replace deprecated Terminal.getWidth/getHeight with
      getColumns/getRows
    + MNG-8129: Clarify relativePath validation comment
    + Add integration test for #12660: BOM version from imported
      BOM
    + Use try-with-resources for AuthenticationContext
    + Fix deprecated Maven testing API compatibility
    + Move the core IT suite off the JUnit 4 assertions
    + Remove workaround for creating site output directory
    + Build and deploy through the wrapper on Jenkins
    + Build the wrapper job with Maven 4.0.0-rc-6
  * Bug Fixes
    + Improve standalone ApiRunner to properly apply settings
    + Strip executable() conditions from consumer POMs
    + Emit clear error when running JDK cannot compile source level
    + Enable PathConflictResolver by default
    + [mvnup] Add maven-war-plugin and maven-ear-plugin to plugin
      upgrade list
    + Fix #13191: add -Dmaven.maven3Personality hint to FATAL
      message for wrong parent relativePath
    + Fix #13200: publish a complete set from
      MavenProject.getArtifacts
    + Fix #13190: pre-build full reactor once using BUILD_PROJECT,
      drop temp dir in PluginUpgradeStrategy
    + Fix #13192: PomInlinerTransformer fails when CI-friendly
      property is defined in POM
    + Fix #13189: mvnup generates invalid JDK version constraint
      '(,-1]'
    + Fix mvnup compatibility: jar-plugin 3.4.2, exec-plugin
      submodule coverage, toolchain warning
    + Fixes #13135, ensure completude of the reactor summary but
      privilege failures to be last to stay human efficient
    + Fix glob patterns in exists()/missing() profile conditions on
      Windows
    + Fix #13084: sandbox profile activation context for external
      model builds
    + Fix: implement Node.getRepository() via local repository
      manager lookup
    + Fix #13100: honor repositories from legitimately-active
      external model profiles
    + MNG-5146: Fix parent relativePath mismatch check
    + Lower-case the OS family before matching it against the
      family names
    + Normalize lazy StAX parse failures in MavenXpp3Reader
    + Evaluate profile activation conditions lazily
    + MNG-6979: Initialize the current project from the execution
      root
    + Fix NPE on a recursive property reference in a list field
    + MNG-6568: Fix comparison cycles in version qualifiers
    + MNG-8678: Concurrent executor ignores java.lang.Error
      subclasses
    + Keep the basedir unset for a parent served from the
      project-local repository
    + Fix #13068: make PluginDependenciesResolver methods default
    + Fix filterByScope to expand lifecycle scopes for build
      ordering
    + Fix getDispatchedPaths() leaking mutable nested lists
    + MNG-8174: Fix NPE when a property references itself in a
      plugin configuration
    + Fix #12985: Upgrade toolchains-plugin when adding
      select-jdk-toolchain execution
    + Fix ToolchainPluginStrategy to detect inherited source levels
      from parent POMs
    + Fix consumer POM leaving extension-contributed user
      properties uninterpolated
    + Fix #12986: Throw descriptive UnsupportedOperationException
      instead of NPE in MavenSession.lookup()
