    + MNG-12984: Fix invalid Automatic-Module-Name entries in mvnup
      plugin upgrades
    + Fix compatibility spelling in CLI help text
    + MNG-8708: Fix parent inference
    + Scope server credentials and validate legacy relocation
      coordinates
    + Fix version comparison and parsing inconsistencies in
      maven-artifact
    + Validate metadata inputs across legacy and new API paths,
      clone proxies before decryption
    + MNG-8450: Report BOM import warnings only at declaration
      sites
    + MNG-8287: Fix consumer POM packaging profile resolution
    + Fix #12931: do not rewrite unmodified POMs in mvnup apply
    + Fix modello velocity phase for concurrent builder
