    + Wire ModelBuilderRequest.isLocationTracking() to XML parser
    + Fix #12590: NPE on null rootDirectory in DefaultModelBuilder
    + Fix #12749: suppress false ERROR in mvnsh for successful
      commands
    + Fix #12769: merge duplicate mirror repos to preserve snapshot
