    + Preserve coordinates when merging InputLocation
    + Fix: synchronize ReflectionValueExtractor class-introspection
      caches
    + Fix duplicate model problem reporting, fixes #12691
    + Fix ArtifactCoordinates.getId() double colon when classifier
      is empty
    + MNG-8129: Handle InvalidPathException for broken relativePath
      on Windows
    + Fix #12761: do not wait for the terminal on the thread
