    + Make run-its profile extract the built distribution
    + MDEP-590: Resolve classified POM artifacts from the reactor
    + MNG-8709: Use active profile properties for consumer POM
      validation
    + Fix #12730: quiet mode implies raw streams to avoid stdout
      decoration
    + Fix #12640: BOM consumer POM must not include inherited
      dependency management
    + Make profile activation conditions locale-independent
    + Fix parent profile cache matching across activation contexts
    + fix(api-core): properly implement Clock.withZone() in
